'''IT Catacombs''' (ITカタコンベ ''IT Katakonbe'', '''IT Catacomb''') is the 41st sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in the [[Version 6.3 Update]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is definitely one of the hardest in Stories of Legend. Often enough, you find yourself in several stages where a victory is nearly impossible without the right strategy. The worst stages are probably [[Caliban's Keeper]] (one [[Henry]] and three [[R.Ost]]s), [[OS Graveyard]] ([[Professor A.]] and [[Bun Bun Black]] spawn at the start, with [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawning once one of them is dead), and [[The Holy Exploit]] (A [[Razorback]] and [[Boraphim]] spawning at the same time with minimal cash).
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Croakley]]: A decently resilient traitless enemy with [[Long Distance]] ability (900 standing range, 1,100~1,400 effective range) and a 60-second slow effect. However, both his damage and speed pale in comparison.

